     "note": "Removed `'--no-simulate'` from the yt-dlp args array (was at line 76). `--dump-json` alone runs yt-dlp in simulate mode, fetching only metadata. With `--no-simulate` present, yt-dlp performed full stream probing (manifests, segment resolution) before printing JSON, consuming unnecessary network budget against the 8-second `LENS_YTDLP_TIMEOUT_MS` limit. TypeScript typecheck passed after the change."
